 "notes": [
  "Kit batch 8504 (lane kit-batch-8504-20261121, group 2). Only one wall has a 2024-2025 panorama (w01-254, foliage); the others are from 2016-2021 crops archived with --suffix m/o.",
  "Groups: 0 the W end of the NW wing (w01-254oL 2021-03-18): five storeys, four punched columns, a storage door in the ground; 1 the S end of the SE wing (w03-191m 2016-05-19): four columns, ground windows; 2 the N face of the SE wing (w02-11m 2021-01-26, oblique 42 deg): three columns and the glass-block stair column at its curve end; 3 the E face of the NW wing (w04-75m 2021-01-26): the glass-block stair column at the curve end and three columns; 4 the E end of the SE wing (w05-101m 2017-07-05): the recessed stack of curved balconies over a glazed ground between two window columns.",
  "The bent middle (four storeys, 3DBAG facets of 2.5-3.5 m on both sides) and the short N ends of the NW wing have no crop (the facets are under the crop length) and stay in the window grid."
 ]
